# Max-side scratch files
Soniq.Bridge/.amxd.tmp
Soniq.Bridge/.maxpat.tmp

# Soniq.Bridge.amxd AND Soniq.Bridge.maxproj are intentionally committed —
# the device binary + Max Project descriptor are required for clone-and-go.
# Max will edit local-only fields in the .maxproj (viewrect, timestamps) on
# each save; treat those diffs as noise.
